<title>HONG KONG: Albatronics interim net up 47.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Albatronics interim net up 47.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.77	 vs 2.55</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
